Scope

This licence covers this port's own code, documentation and sample mods. It
grants no rights to the original games (The Terminator: SkyNET, The
Terminator: Future Shock) or their data, none of which is included.

The values in data/tables come from the original game's executable
(SKYNET.EXE v1.01). They are included only for interoperability, so the port
runs with the player's own copy of the game.

SkyNET, Future Shock, Bethesda and The Terminator are trademarks of their
respective owners. This is an unofficial fan port, not affiliated with or
endorsed by them. Third-party components: see THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.
